"**NavIC Support:** Native support for Indian Regional Navigation Satellite "
"System (IRNSS) on L5 band."
msgstr "**NavIC 支持：** 原生支持 L5 频段的印度区域导航卫星系统（IRNSS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroNav-1.rst:17 3fecd31272ef476db5fdd4326a1d0fa1
